      <p>Yes. You can customize the PDF with your logo, colors, contact details, and commercial terms so every quote represents your agency professionally.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can I add hotels, transfers, and insurance to the PDF? <span class="text-magenta">▼</span></summary>
      <p>Yes. Besides the flights from the PNR, you can include hotels, transfers, insurance, tours, and any other service that makes up the travel package.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Does the client see my net costs or commissions? <span class="text-magenta">▼</span></summary>
      <p>No. The PDF only shows the final selling price. Net costs, commissions, and internal remarks remain hidden to protect your margin.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Is it free to convert PNR to PDF? <span class="text-magenta">▼</span></summary>
      <p>The free PNR Converter lets you generate visual itineraries. For branded PDFs, CRM tracking, and unlimited quotes, you can try Quotix free for 7 days.</p>
    </details>
  </section>
</ArticleLayout>
